-- The expression after OF in a WITHIN is an instant: a NUMBER on the trace's
-- own clock, or a DATE (EVERY-EACH-QUANTIFIER-SPEC §5.1.1, R-Q7C). A STRING
-- is neither, and the refusal names both types it would accept.

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Buyer
    Seller

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Pay
    Deliver

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
bad MEANS PARTY Buyer MUST Pay WITHIN 5 OF "next Tuesday"
